{"ocrText": "170\nIN  REFUTATION  OF  SINISTER  RUMOURS\nListok \u201cPravdy\u201d of July 6 carried a detailed refutation\nof the foul slander spread by the Black Hundred papers*\nwith regard to Lenin and others. A similar refutation, in\na briefer form, was published as a separate leaflet on be-\nhalf  of  our  Party  Central  Committee.\nIn addition, we have only to answer the following ques-\ntion put to us: are the rumours concerning the arrest of\nLenin, Kamenev, Zinoviev and others true? No, these\nrumours are untrue. All the Bolsheviks named here who are\nbaited with particular zeal by the vile and slanderous press\nare members of the All-Russia Central Executive Committee\nof the Soviets of Workers\u2019 and Soldiers\u2019 Deputies. Once\nagain we request all fair-minded citizens not to believe\nthese  infamous  slanders  and  sinister  rumours.\nWritten  on  July  7  (20),  1917\nFirst  published  in  1928\nPublished  according  to\nin  Lenin  Miscellany  VII\nthe  manuscript\n* See  pp.  157-62  of  this  volume.\u2014Ed.", "textLayer": [{"text": "170", "x": 11.11, "y": 6.06, "w": 3.19, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "IN", "x": 20.86, "y": 28.26, "w": 3.2, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "REFUTATION", "x": 25.54, "y": 28.26, "w": 19.02, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "OF", "x": 46.01, "y": 28.26, "w": 3.81, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "SINISTER", "x": 51.32, "y": 28.26, "w": 13.84, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "RUMOURS", "x": 66.61, "y": 28.26, "w": 14.77, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "Listok", "x": 13.9, "y": 32.78, "w": 9.21, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "\u201c", "x": 23.7, "y": 32.76, "w": 1.47, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Pravdy", "x": 25.33, "y": 32.78, "w": 9.5, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "\u201d of July 6 carried a detailed refutation", "x": 34.99, "y": 32.76, "w": 56.13, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "of the foul slander spread by the Black Hundred papers", "x": 11.11, "y": 34.7, "w": 78.43, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "*", "x": 89.72, "y": 34.25, "w": 1.4, "h": 2.19, "fontSize": 13.0}, {"text": "with regard to Lenin and others. A similar refutation, in", "x": 11.11, "y": 36.62, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "a briefer form, was published as a separate leaflet on be-", "x": 11.11, "y": 38.56, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "half  of  our  Party  Central  Committee.", "x": 11.11, "y": 40.5, "w": 52.04, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "In addition, we have only to answer the following ques-", "x": 13.9, "y": 42.44, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "tion put to us: are the rumours concerning the arrest of", "x": 11.11, "y": 44.38, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Lenin, Kamenev, Zinoviev and others true? No, these", "x": 11.11, "y": 46.32, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "rumours are", "x": 11.11, "y": 48.23, "w": 16.96, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "untrue", "x": 28.53, "y": 48.25, "w": 8.56, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ". All the Bolsheviks named here who are", "x": 37.16, "y": 48.23, "w": 53.96, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "baited with particular zeal by the vile and slanderous press", "x": 11.11, "y": 50.17, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "are members of the All-Russia Central Executive Committee", "x": 11.11, "y": 52.11, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "of the Soviets of Workers\u2019 and Soldiers\u2019 Deputies. Once", "x": 11.11, "y": 54.05, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "again we request all fair-minded citizens not to believe", "x": 11.11, "y": 55.99, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "these  infamous  slanders  and  sinister  rumours.", "x": 11.11, "y": 57.93, "w": 63.32, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Written", "x": 11.11, "y": 61.81, "w": 7.58, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "on", "x": 19.61, "y": 61.81, "w": 2.27, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "July", "x": 22.81, "y": 61.81, "w": 3.99, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "7", "x": 27.7, "y": 61.86, "w": 0.84, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "(", "x": 29.57, "y": 61.81, "w": 0.67, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "20", "x": 30.37, "y": 61.86, "w": 2.12, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "),", "x": 32.71, "y": 61.81, "w": 1.33, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "1917", "x": 34.93, "y": 61.86, "w": 3.95, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "First", "x": 13.63, "y": 63.66, "w": 4.65, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "published", "x": 19.2, "y": 63.66, "w": 9.26, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "in", "x": 29.33, "y": 63.66, "w": 1.84, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "1928", "x": 32.09, "y": 63.72, "w": 4.26, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "Published", "x": 68.24, "y": 63.66, "w": 9.43, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "according", "x": 78.58, "y": 63.66, "w": 9.36, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "to", "x": 88.83, "y": 63.66, "w": 1.82, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "in", "x": 12.95, "y": 65.0, "w": 1.84, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Lenin", "x": 15.67, "y": 65.01, "w": 5.7, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Miscellany", "x": 22.31, "y": 65.01, "w": 10.7, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "VII", "x": 33.9, "y": 65.01, "w": 3.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "the", "x": 72.06, "y": 65.0, "w": 2.97, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "manuscript", "x": 75.94, "y": 65.0, "w": 10.89, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "*", "x": 13.72, "y": 87.07, "w": 1.29, "h": 2.02, "fontSize": 12.0}, {"text": "See  pp.  157-62  of  this  volume.\u2014", "x": 15.56, "y": 87.23, "w": 39.04, "h": 1.52, "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": "Ed", "x": 54.76, "y": 87.24, "w": 3.09, "h": 1.52, "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": ".", "x": 58.01, "y": 87.23, "w": 0.6, "h": 1.52, "fontSize": 9.0}]}